  "body": "Tucked away in a quiet Browns Bay cul-de-sac, in the sought-after Rangitoto College zone, this solid single-level brick home has been cared for by the same owners for almost 20 years. North-facing and full of sunshine, it offers the practicality, charm and potential you don't always find in newer homes, plus two off-street parks.\r\n\r\nNot ready for retirement living? This low-maintenance, single-level home could be your perfect next move, with no stairs, an easy-care section and everything Browns Bay has to offer just minutes away.\r\n\r\nInside, there are two double-glazed bedrooms, a light-filled living area and a converted garage, currently used as a home office and guest room (unconsented, see note).\r\n\r\nHighlights\r\n\r\n• North-facing and sunny\r\n• Single-level living with no stairs\r\n• Two off-street parks\r\n• Double glazing to the bedrooms (2024)\r\n• Converted garage, currently a home office and guest room (unconsented, see note)\r\n• Built-in EV charging point at the front of the house\r\n• Solid, low-maintenance, mainly brick home\r\n• Fully fenced, easy-care section\r\n• Quiet cul-de-sac, just minutes from Browns Bay Beach and village\r\n\r\nMake it your own\r\nThe sunny, elevated rear garden is full of potential, whether that's a deck, a pergola or your own private sanctuary. There may also be scope to add a double carport (see the concept image in the photo gallery).\r\n\r\nBrowns Bay on your doorstep\r\nBrowns Bay Beach and the village are only minutes away, with plenty of shops, cafés and restaurants to enjoy, plus buses on East Coast Road and easy access to Albany and the motorway.\r\n\r\nSought-after school zones\r\nIn zone for Rangitoto College and Long Bay College, Murrays Bay and Northcross Intermediates, and Pinehill and Sherwood Schools.\r\n\r\nReady for its next owners\r\nA great fit for downsizers, first-home buyers or investors looking for a well-kept home in a quiet, convenient location.\r\n\r\nAsking Price $1,099,000\r\nGet in touch today to arrange a viewing, or come along to the next open home.\r\n\r\nPlease note: the garage conversion is unconsented, with no Certificate of Acceptance (CoA) or Code Compliance Certificate (CCC). Any improvements or additions mentioned, including the double carport, deck and pergola, are subject to purchaser due diligence and all required council and cross-lease consents. Buyers should seek their own legal and technical advice.",
